<section class="sg-sec" id="inspired"><h2>What it inspired</h2><ul class="sg-chain"><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Jambo – Hakuna Matata (Boney M.)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1983</span><span class="sg-chain-h">cover with new English words</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Jambo Jambo (Safari Sound Band)</span><span class="sg-chain-h">cover with changed words</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Jambo Bwana (Mombasa Roots)</span><span class="sg-chain-h">cover</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Jambo Bwana (Khadja Nin)</span><span class="sg-chain-h">cover</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Jambo Bwana (Adam Solomon)</span><span class="sg-chain-h">cover</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Jambo Bwana (Mani Kollengode)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">2016</span><span class="sg-chain-h">cover</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">The Lion King (Disney)</span><span class="sg-chain-h">a phrase from the song's chorus used as a reference to it</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">African Playground (Putumayo Kids)</span><span class="sg-chain-h">included on the compilation</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Where'd You Go, Bernadette (film, Richard Linklater)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">2019</span><span class="sg-chain-h">featured in the film</span></li></ul></section>
